  "brain_first": "“先问这里真的需要名词吗；需要的话再看一个还是多个、要不 要所有格。”",
  "sort_order": 1051,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "括号给 noun，如 necessity, success, child。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "名词变化包括 plural, possessive，以及 noun →",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "adjective/adverb 等派生。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先问这里真的需要名词吗；需要的话再看一个还是多个、要不",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "要所有格。”",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 名词空常被数量词、冠词、形容词和谓语一致提示。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看空位前后，判断句子需要名词还是别的词性。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 若是名词，看可数/不可数。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 看数量提示：many, several, one of, a variety of。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 看是否表示所属：the students' projects。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 若空修饰名词或动词，考虑词性转换。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· many/several + plural",
      "sourcePage": 78,
      "sourceIndex": 2175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· one of + plural noun",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· much/little + uncountable",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 名词修饰名词不等于总要变形容词，需按固定用法",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 词性和数都与上下文一致。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不知道可数性时，查限定词和谓语是否提供线索。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Families came to buy daily ___ (necessity). daily necessities 表示多种日用品，复数。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只因为前面有the就用单数。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2184
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略one of后复数。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2185
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2186
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 词性对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2187
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 可数吗？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2188
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 单复数有线索吗？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2189
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2190
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 给名词：先词性，再数。",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. two ___ (child)",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. the ___ decision (company)",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 名词提示词前有many，通常？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 名词位置却句子需要形容词，怎么办？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. success→形容词？",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. children；2. company’s / company decision 视语境；3. 复数；4. 词性转换。；5. successful",
      "sourcePage": 79,
      "sourceIndex": 2201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF3”或题型关键词。—",
